//api.github.com/users/h1v9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-15T12:55:47Z","updated_at":"2025-08-15T12:57:46Z","body":"> Sounds like:\n> \n> * [Loading resources from PCK is 5-10x slower in Android export #105852](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105852)\n\nInteresting.\nThe user says to put this in build.gradle\n```\n    androidResources {\n        noCompress += \"pck\"\n    }\n```\nBut pck files are not built with gradle, how can this help?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3191439225/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3191445176","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109635#issuecomment-3191445176","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109635","id":3191445176,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-OZa4","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-15T12:59:08Z","updated_at":"2025-08-15T12:59:08Z","body":"> The user says to put this in build.gradle\n\nThis will only do something if PCK is inside APK. And I think in the current 4.5 beta, PCK is already in no-compress list by default.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3191445176/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3193607508","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109635#issuecomment-3193607508","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109635","id":3193607508,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-WpVU","user":{"login":"h1v9","id":17818610,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3ODE4NjEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17818610?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9","html_url":"https://github.com/h1v9","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-16T11:36:03Z","updated_at":"2025-08-16T11:36:03Z","body":"I had a quick look with a profiler and the slowest calls seem to be `ResourceLoaderBinary::load()` first and `ResourceLoaderBinary::open()` second. With `Object::set()` and `ResourceLoaderBinary::parse_variant()` taking most of `ResourceLoaderBinary::load()`'s time.\nIt also looks like the number of loaded files affects the speed more than the size of the loaded files.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3193607508/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3193928498","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109635#issuecomment-3193928498","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109635","id":3193928498,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-X3sy","user":{"login":"h1v9","id":17818610,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3ODE4NjEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17818610?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9","html_url":"https://github.com/h1v9","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-16T21:57:03Z","updated_at":"2025-08-16T21:57:03Z","body":"Never mind big files are extremely slow aswell.\nLoading 8 custom resources (made of a couple of dicts and an Animation Library), about 25 MB each, takes 167 seconds in total.\nFor reference, loading them from the APK takes about 10 seconds, loading them on pc takes 1.5 seconds.\n\nI've used https://ui.perfetto.dev/ to profile the loading process, here's a trace you can open on the website.\n[slow_load.perfetto_trace.gz](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21818070/slow_load.perfetto_trace.gz)\n\n<img width=\"2306\" height=\"1142\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3a56cab0-18c8-43fd-b110-cf182143e906\" />\nSeems like it's slowing down because ResourceLoaderBinary::parse_variant() is reading data in tiny franctions calling FileAccess::get_32() hundreds of times\n\nThis is brutally slow and basically unusable, any idea/alternative?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3193928498/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3214139750","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109635#issuecomment-3214139750","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109635","id":3214139750,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_k-Fm","user":{"login":"h1v9","id":17818610,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3ODE4NjEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17818610?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9","html_url":"https://github.com/h1v9","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-22T12:07:02Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T12:07:02Z","body":"Update: Using ResourceSaver.FLAG_COMPRESS when saving the custom resource with ResourceSaver dramatically increased the loading time from 167 seconds 8 seconds even tho the files are just half the size. I'm guessing it forces the engine to load the whole file instead of streaming it?\nThis should be the default behaviour for uncompressed files aswell","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3214139750/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3214156290","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109635#issuecomment-3214156290","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109635","id":3214156290,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_lCIC","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-22T12:13:35Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T12:13:35Z","body":"> This should be the default behaviour for uncompressed files aswell\n\nFor the normal file systems it should not, reads like this are cached by OS and fast. But in case of `FileAccessFilesystemJAndroid` it probably makes sense to do, since all calls go through JNI.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3214156290/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3214205097","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109635#issuecomment-3214205097","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109635","id":3214205097,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_lOCp","user":{"login":"h1v9","id":17818610,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3ODE4NjEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17818610?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9","html_url":"https://github.com/h1v9","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":